\paragraph{Significance threshold sensitivity.}
Table~\ref{tab:threshold_sensitivity} reports the effect of varying the significance threshold $\alpha_s$ on treatment ($\alpha{=}0.75$, 3~seeds) versus null ($\alpha{=}0.0$, 3~seeds) separation for permutation Granger tests.
